Package: wiretap-server-ui
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Alex Ferrara <alex@wiredsquare.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: init-system-helpers (>= 1.54), adduser, ca-certificates, wiretap-server
Conflicts: wiretap-server-ui-image
Replaces: wiretap-server-ui-image
Description: web UI for the WireTAP capture daemon
 Built on the Wired Square appliance chassis. Serves its interface over TLS.
 .
 It keeps a control socket for an operator in the wiretap-server-ui group, which is the
 way in when nobody can sign in:
 .
   /run/wiretap-server-ui/wiretap-server-ui.sock
